# Signing keys and the Apple push key, gathered for handover. Most are copies
# of files already ignored above, but keystore.properties and the folder's own
# README are not — so the whole directory is ignored, not just its contents by
# extension. Unquoted on purpose: git treats quotes in a pattern as literal
# characters, and spaces in a path need no escaping (only trailing ones do).
فایل های حساس/

# Next.js build traces. Nothing in this repo is a Next.js app; .next/trace and
# .next/trace-build were committed by a tool run in the wrong directory and
# tracked for a while before being removed.
.next/

# Client-facing delivery page (delivery/README.md) — ~210 MB of vendored
# Swagger UI and downloadable builds, published by manual upload to cPanel,
# not from this repo.
delivery/
delivery-report/

# Stale artifact of a one-off TypeScript error-count budget. The count it held
